---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 150
    rankSpacing: 80
  themeVariables:
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Vigilo
    participant ControlDB as Control DB
    participant ExecutionDB as Execution DBs
    participant Queue as RabbitMQ

    User->>Vigilo: vigilo coordinator once
    activate Vigilo
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Load throughput knobs and generate coordinator id
    Vigilo->>Vigilo: Load database and messaging contexts

    Vigilo->>ControlDB: List active execution placements
    ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Execution database aliases
    Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Recover expired chunk leases per alias
    ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Recovered chunks and poison chunks failed

    loop Dispatch bounded run-shard windows
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Select and lock open run-shard cursor
        ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Dispatch route or no work
        Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Upsert run snapshot and enqueue chunk-ready window
        ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Dispatch shard window result
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Release or drain dispatch cursor
    end

    loop Finalize bounded terminal runs
        Vigilo->>ControlDB: Claim finalizable run
        ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Finalization claim or no work
        alt Run claimed
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Read routed shard summaries
            ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Terminal summary rows
            Vigilo->>ControlDB: Roll up counts, set gate, and enqueue completion event
            ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Finalized run or no update
        end
    end

    Vigilo->>ControlDB: List active outbox placements
    ControlDB-->>Vigilo: Database aliases
    Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Claim publishable outbox rows per alias
    ExecutionDB-->>Vigilo: Joined event payload batches

    loop Bounded outbox publish concurrency
        Vigilo->>Queue: Declare durable topology and publish persistent mandatory event
        Queue-->>Vigilo: Confirmed routed publish or returned/nacked publish
        alt Publish confirmed and claim token current
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Mark ledger published and delete delivery row
        else Publish failed or unroutable
            Vigilo->>ExecutionDB: Reschedule delivery row for retry with claim token
        else Claim token no longer current
            Vigilo->>Vigilo: Ignore stale publisher result
        end
    end

    Vigilo-->>User: Success response
    deactivate Vigilo
